[[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p>With the engine cold, blow through with\ncompressed air in the spark plug openings to remove any foreign bodies\nor traces of dirt.</p><p>1. Undo the small side spark plugs (1a) and the large centre spark\nplugs (1b) and remove them.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018659.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p>Check the condition of the spark plugs\nand, if necessary, replace them.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Using different spark plugs from\nthose recommended can cause damage to the engine and alter the exhaust\nemission levels.</p></aside>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the small side spark plugs and\nthe large centre spark plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CENTRE SPARK PLUG</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5 - 3.6</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>SIDE SPARK PLUG</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.1 - 1.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238432\">5530B22</a></p>"],[16,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237530\">1048A48</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238401\">5510C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238400\">5510C16</a></p><p>Undo and remove the spark plugs.</p>"],[16,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the spark plugs and tighten them\nto torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Spark plug</p></td><td><p>SPARK PLUGS</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.1 - 4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238400\">5510C16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238401\">5510C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237530\">1048A48</a></p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the spark plugs and remove them.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018660.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the spark plugs back in their housings\nand tighten them to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>SPARK PLUGS</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.4 ÷ 3.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]